# 5-security-office-form.trk -- one row per bar (4 s at the fixed 60 BPM form
# clock); 30 bars of scene + a silent bar. Written in G; the tape speed in the
# patch moves everything down to ~Bb. '>' ramps to the next value.
#
# bar  s    event
#  0    0   rain outside, tape hiss and hum
#  1    4   pa-security on the walkie-talkie
#  3   12   the drone: Em9 struck, frozen at bar 5
#  6   24   iv-guard on the TV
#  9   36   rewind (scrub backwards)
# 11   44   the found tape: the jingle, twice; stops at bar 14
# 15   60   fast-forward
# 16   64   the drone thaws and moves to Cmaj9, frozen again at bar 18
# 17   68   wx-flood on the TV
# 21   84   pa-closed, far away over the empty mall
# 25  100   everything fades; rain last; silence by bar 30

track drone  note cva cvb cvd   # 1  chord struck into the freezing plate
track freeze cva                # 2  plate freeze gate (0/1)
track pasec  note               # 3  pa-security (walkie)
track guard  note               # 4  iv-guard (TV)
track flood  note               # 5  wx-flood (TV)
track closed note               # 6  pa-closed (PA)
track rew    note               # 7  rewind scrub
track ff     note               # 8  fast-forward scrub
track tstop  cva                # 9  tape stop on the found tape: 0 run, 1 stopped
track rain   cva                # 10 rain outside
track dlvl   cva                # 11 drone level
track main   cva                # 12 master fade
track duck   cva                # 13 bed level under voices (1 = none)

pattern scene 31
#    drone              frz  pasec  guard  flood  closed rew   ff    tstop  rain   dlvl   main  duck
00 | .                | 0  | .    | .    | .    | .    | .   | .   | 0    | .8   | 0    | 1   | 1
01 | .                | .  | x:3  | .    | .    | .    | .   | .   | .    | .    | .    | .   | .5
03 | E3:2 G3 B3 Fs4   | .  | .    | .    | .    | .    | .   | .   | .    | .    | .8   | .   | .
04 | .                | .  | .    | .    | .    | .    | .   | .   | .    | .    | .    | .   | 1
05 | .                | 1  | .    | .    | .    | .    | .   | .   | .    | .    | .    | .   | .
06 | .                | .  | .    | x:3  | .    | .    | .   | .   | .    | .    | .    | .   | .5
09 | .                | .  | .    | .    | .    | .    | x:2 | .   | .    | .    | .    | .   | 1
11 | .                | .  | .    | .    | .    | .    | .   | .   | .    | .    | .    | .   | .8
14 | .                | .  | .    | .    | .    | .    | .   | .   | 1    | .    | .    | .   | .
15 | .                | .  | .    | .    | .    | .    | .   | x:1 | 0    | .    | .    | .   | 1
16 | C3:2 E3 B3 D4    | 0  | .    | .    | .    | .    | .   | .   | .    | .    | .    | .   | .
17 | .                | .  | .    | .    | x:2  | .    | .   | .   | .    | .    | .    | .   | .5
18 | .                | 1  | .    | .    | .    | .    | .   | .   | .    | .    | .    | .   | .
19 | .                | .  | .    | .    | .    | .    | .   | .   | .    | .    | .    | .   | 1
21 | .                | .  | .    | .    | .    | x:4  | .   | .   | .    | .    | .    | .   | .35
25 | .                | 0  | .    | .    | .    | .    | .   | .   | .    | .8>  | .8>  | .   | 1
28 | .                | .  | .    | .    | .    | .    | .   | .   | .    | .5   | 0    | .   | .
29 | .                | .  | .    | .    | .    | .    | .   | .   | .    | 0    | .    | 1>  | .
30 | .                | .  | .    | .    | .    | .    | .   | .   | .    | .    | .    | 0   | .

order scene
